            <ArticleTitle>Metatarsalgia: an ultrasound perspective.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>493-9</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Research on metatarsophalangeal joint instability and the plantar plate was conducted from May 2002 to May 2006. Along with plantar plate tears, we found a range of pathologies. This is a pictorial review of our experience.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
